PAL16L8
SNESDOP3
Dopple Board RAM Array Control PAL
Phil Torre,Utopia Engineering, Seattle

RAMW RAMO TA0 HA0 HDATA TDATA TW0 TW1 PIN9 GND
EIGHTBIT XBUS W0 W1 O0 O1 PIN17 PIN18 PIN19 VCC

/XBUS =		/TDATA * TA0 +
		/HDATA * HA0

/W0 = 		/RAMW * /TDATA * /TA0 +
		/RAMW * /HDATA * /HA0

/W1 =		/RAMW * /TDATA *  TA0 +
		/RAMW * /HDATA *  HA0

/O0 =		/RAMO * /TDATA * /TA0 +
		/RAMO * /HDATA * /HA0

/O1 =		/RAMO * /TDATA *  TA0 +
		/RAMO * /HDATA *  HA0


END
